WEBVTT

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:28.916
MISSION 6
ASSASSINATE A PRETTY GIRL

00:00:36.666 --> 00:00:38.833
Now you die!

00:00:40.541 --> 00:00:43.083
Why is my fate so cruel?

00:00:44.041 --> 00:00:46.458
Those born with exquisite charms
are always cursed.

00:00:47.166 --> 00:00:48.875
Why are beautiful women like me...

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:51.958
always made the toys of fate?

00:00:55.125 --> 00:00:57.166
For your terrible acting, now you die!

00:00:57.250 --> 00:00:59.083
Wait! Do I really have to die today?

00:00:59.166 --> 00:01:01.083
There is no way
you'll see the sunrise tomorrow.

00:01:01.166 --> 00:01:02.833
So, that means this is
the last day of my life?

00:01:02.916 --> 00:01:03.791
That's right.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.708
Before I die,
there are some things I want to do.

00:01:06.791 --> 00:01:08.666
Help me do them, and you can kill me.

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:10.666
Is it ever that easy?

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:12.083
You're not lying to me, are you?

00:01:12.166 --> 00:01:14.875
But you're so smart.
How could a lie get past you?

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:18.208
You have a very good point.

00:01:19.083 --> 00:01:20.208
Deal accepted.

00:01:20.833 --> 00:01:23.000
This is my pre-death wish list.

00:01:23.875 --> 00:01:26.791
Help me finish these things,
and then I can die.

00:01:27.583 --> 00:01:30.166
Come on, let's get it done
so I can kill you.

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:32.291
But I want you to carry me!

00:01:33.125 --> 00:01:36.625
I can't move...

00:01:36.708 --> 00:01:37.791
GIRL WITH SPECIAL POWER
COLA

00:01:37.875 --> 00:01:38.875
PASSIVE SKILL
PARALYZES OPPOSITE SEX THROUGH TOUCH

00:01:38.958 --> 00:01:40.250
Let go. Let go.

00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:41.875
If you don't help me, I'll make you--

00:01:41.958 --> 00:01:44.375
Tell me after you let go!

00:02:12.291 --> 00:02:13.125
HICCUP

00:02:13.208 --> 00:02:16.750
PRE-DEATH WISH LIST
1. DRINK A BOTTLE OF COLA IN ONE BREATH

00:02:21.666 --> 00:02:24.541
2. PEE STANDING UP

00:02:31.708 --> 00:02:32.875
Don't look! Don't look!

00:02:37.875 --> 00:02:41.166
He's a naughty boy! A naughty boy!
A very naughty boy!

00:02:46.458 --> 00:02:48.958
Hey, wait. Why am I the naked one?

00:02:49.458 --> 00:02:50.750
Why didn't you take off your clothes?

00:02:50.833 --> 00:02:54.875
3. (WATCH SOMEONE ELSE)
RUN NAKED IN PUBLIC

00:03:07.458 --> 00:03:08.833
We're in trouble! Run!

00:03:16.791 --> 00:03:17.833
You're so brave!

00:03:19.083 --> 00:03:21.333
I can't move!

00:03:21.416 --> 00:03:24.375
4. GIVE A NURSE A SHOT

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:26.958
I'm sorry,
all our tables are booked today.

00:03:42.541 --> 00:03:44.166
Waiter, the check!

00:03:45.833 --> 00:03:49.291
So, this thing costs 5,000 yuan?
You must really be rich.

00:03:56.250 --> 00:04:00.250
Don't tell me.
You don't have money for the bill.

00:04:06.333 --> 00:04:09.208
5. EAT AT A MICHELIN 3-STAR RESTAURANT

00:04:09.791 --> 00:04:12.291
Next, we beat up a scumbag.

00:04:52.791 --> 00:04:56.500
6. VICIOUSLY WOUND EX-BOYFRIEND'S BALLS

00:05:01.083 --> 00:05:04.000
Look at how tired he is.

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:07.291
Let's not bother him.

00:05:08.791 --> 00:05:09.666
Again?

00:05:19.625 --> 00:05:21.083
Nice!

00:05:28.416 --> 00:05:29.333
March!

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:53.208
7. RIDE A LION

00:05:57.625 --> 00:06:00.916
We don't have an airplane or a parachute.

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:02.750
Let's forget skydiving.

00:06:03.791 --> 00:06:05.500
Then I won't die.

00:06:07.375 --> 00:06:10.583
You think you don't have to die
just because you say so?

00:06:11.208 --> 00:06:12.583
I can't move!

00:06:14.458 --> 00:06:17.875
If you don't help me,
I'll make it so you never move again.

00:06:18.583 --> 00:06:19.541
Wait, wait!

00:06:19.625 --> 00:06:22.458
I have an idea. Just let go.

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:26.333
What are you looking for?

00:06:27.083 --> 00:06:29.000
I'll get shy if you look at me that way.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:34.458
Super speed flying chicken!

00:06:34.916 --> 00:06:37.583
There's a girl here,
so could you not grab me down there?

00:06:44.875 --> 00:06:47.083
Higher!

00:06:48.916 --> 00:06:50.583
Higher!

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:56.750
Higher!

00:06:56.833 --> 00:06:59.625
We can't go any higher!

00:06:59.708 --> 00:07:02.041
Earth, I'm coming!

00:07:29.375 --> 00:07:31.750
A huge plane!

00:07:43.916 --> 00:07:45.666
I'm flying!

00:08:15.625 --> 00:08:18.666
8. SKYDIVE

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:21.250
Why didn't you get out of the way
when you saw the tree?

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:24.416
Because I couldn't move
when you were sitting on me! Why else?

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:35.250
What was the last thing you wanted to do?

00:08:35.333 --> 00:08:36.833
Let's get it done so you can die.

00:08:37.541 --> 00:08:39.166
What if I suddenly don't want to die?

00:08:40.166 --> 00:08:42.416
After so many tricks,
now you don't want to die?

00:08:43.583 --> 00:08:45.666
I'm so young, and so pretty,

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:48.083
and there are so many fun things
left in the world.

00:08:51.291 --> 00:08:52.291
Wow!

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:56.416
I really don't want to die.

00:08:59.458 --> 00:09:02.666
But I won't live for long.

00:09:08.583 --> 00:09:09.708
I have cancer.

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:13.166
Chemotherapy already made
all my hair fall out.

00:09:14.541 --> 00:09:17.666
Of course,
I'm still very pretty even when I'm bald.

00:09:19.458 --> 00:09:20.708
Who sent you to kill me?

00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:23.708
As a professional killer,

00:09:24.291 --> 00:09:26.416
I can't reveal details about my clients--

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:29.666
It was me. I spent the money
to hire you to kill me...

00:09:31.083 --> 00:09:33.125
because I didn't want to die
in a hospital bed.

00:09:34.250 --> 00:09:35.916
Being assassinated sounds so cool.

00:09:37.166 --> 00:09:39.916
Usually, only famous,
important people get assassinated.

00:09:43.291 --> 00:09:44.125
Do it.

00:09:44.916 --> 00:09:47.375
That was the last thing I wanted to do.

00:10:29.458 --> 00:10:30.916
EAT THEM UP!

00:10:46.125 --> 00:10:49.583
So close and I still missed!
Oh, well, forget it!

00:10:49.666 --> 00:10:51.833
I still will keep your fee, though,

00:10:51.916 --> 00:10:54.875
because I'm going to take you
to see an amazing doctor...

00:10:55.458 --> 00:10:57.708
who might be able to cure you.
